  "instructions": [
    "In a large pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat and add the chopped onion, cooking until translucent.",
    "Add the minced meat and cook until browned, breaking it up into small pieces as it cooks.",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the mincemeat and cook for 1-2 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Stir in the bonito flakes and cook for another minute.",
    "Transfer the mixture to a serving dish and garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve warm or at room temperature."
